OL,3,ATrump welcomes Xi for state dinner at
OL,4,AWhite House alongside major tech bosses
OL,5,
OL,6,FWho has a seat at the table? Big tech
OL,7,Fbosses are on the list, including
OL,8,FTesla's Elon Musk, Apple's Tim Cook,
OL,9,FOpenAI's Sam Altman and Nvidia's Jensen
OL,10,FHuang
OL,12,FEarlier, Trump said he and Xi had made
OL,13,F"tremendous strides on the issues
OL,14,Ffacing our two countries"; Xi,
OL,15,Fmeanwhile, said he hoped "Chinese
OL,16,Fcompanies are treated fairly here"
